                        "sense_id": "c65da30b-3a93-3c62-99d5-b745c3eb68f6",
                        "entry_id": "1929eb8d-2fa2-3427-ba22-1dd0d08fbcca",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To cense; to perfume with incense."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "76c9a743-d1cc-4e4f-9d97-58742f7930c6",
                                "sense_id": "c65da30b-3a93-3c62-99d5-b745c3eb68f6",
                                "text": "The smoak of Censing, smoak of Thurifying"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa988887-f8ea-47af-9e8e-6855770df4bf",
                                "sense_id": "c65da30b-3a93-3c62-99d5-b745c3eb68f6",
                                "text": "After this, the Celebrant goes up to the Altar, thurifies it, and pronounces another Prayer, imploring the Diving Majesty to qualify him for offering up the Sacrifice &c."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14622a89-ed4f-48dd-ae34-6e18b2fce8e2",
                                "sense_id": "c65da30b-3a93-3c62-99d5-b745c3eb68f6",
                                "text": "After this, the mitre is again set on his holiness's head, and the first cardinal-deacon thurifies him three times successively."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
